ication-check" && language === "en")) ? " Keep every separately synthesized sentence in the identical adult Filipina narrator timbre and mid-register as the heading. This is one continuous woman narrator, with no male or secondary announcer voice. Read the exact words; preserve negations, conditions and complete endings." : "") : lessonKey === "bhw-barangay-partners" ? BHW_BARANGAY_PARTNERS_STORY_STYLES[language] + (language === "fil" && section.id === "barangay-partners-application-check" ? " This entire application screen is narrated by the same warm adult Filipina woman, including its title, scenario, question, instructions and takeaway. Keep the curious question in that same female mid-pitched voice; no male/baritone presenter and no separate quizmaster or character voice. Every separately supplied sentence is a continuation of this single woman trainer. Read tanong sa pagsasanay clearly and end every instruction completely." : "") : lessonKey === "bhw-relationships"
